  "limitations": [
    "P03 push (D034): this is a re-review of a chunk that completed earlier on an 8/10 review accepted under D034. It must now pass the full 9/10 gate before the P03 phase review. The tree under review is the current integrated tree (C08-C12 and their follow-up remediation); the chunk's follow-ups file (docs/planning/reviews/<chunk>/follow-ups.md) lists each prior finding and how and where it was remediated, with the guarding tests and probes. Earlier attempts' verdicts are retained.",
    "Native evidence for this re-review was recorded on a fixture bundle prepared from this tree for this chunk. The production rfd panels (NSOpenPanel/NSSavePanel) are now driven natively through a fixture-only switch file (fixture-native-sheets in the fixture data root) that makes the fixture build use the production picker/saver: C10-N10, C11-N10 and C12-N10. Drivers never save an Accessibility tree while a panel lists folders. C09-N11 retires an open confirmation and secret sheet by switching the tenant through Accessibility.",
    "No real product endpoint is called before C25; every read and write runs against the synthetic TLS services named in each chunk's records.",
    "C11's attempt-01 findings R1-R4 and E2 were remediated with C12 (docs/planning/reviews/C11/follow-ups.md); E1 is closed by C11-N10, which saves through the production NSSavePanel (owner-only, a confirmed Replace, Cancel) via the fixture switch fixture-native-sheets. The registered large-collections workload was re-measured on this chunk's prepared bundle (workload-perf.json)."
  ],
